<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūnĭcĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		Punicus. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Reddish</i>, <i>red</i>, <i>purple - colored</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puniceum supparum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Naev. B. P. 2, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taeniae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 269</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">roseta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. E.
					5, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rosa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 10, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crocus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					5, 318</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rotae (currūs Aurorae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 77</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cruor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 607</span></i>
			; also, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 349</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corium,</span>”
				i. e. <i>skin beaten red</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 4, 3, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 3, 411</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pūnĭcĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, <i>Punic</i>, <i>Carthaginian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Puniceus dux,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. Ib.
					284</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
